		"feature_disableLoudnessNormalization_desc": "Stop YouTube nudging the player volume back down below 100%. This does NOT disable YouTube’s loudness normalization, which runs in a Web Audio node an extension can’t reach, so quiet videos stay quiet. Only the volume slider stops drifting.",
